WEBVTT

00:15:58.292 --> 00:16:01.268
but he was certainly
very disappointed at the agent.

00:16:01.292 --> 00:16:03.559
AG: But then, Jason had a change of heart.

00:16:03.583 --> 00:16:05.809
JB: And after sleeping on it
the following day,

00:16:05.833 --> 00:16:08.684
I actually believed in his rationale

00:16:08.708 --> 00:16:10.726
and we increased salary a little bit,

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:14.643
and I think it was a situation
that improved our long-term relationship

00:16:14.667 --> 00:16:16.601
and it also went to show me just,

00:16:16.625 --> 00:16:19.768
hey, it's important
to push hard and be strong

00:16:19.792 --> 00:16:22.434
for your organization
from a negotiation standpoint

00:16:22.458 --> 00:16:25.018
and there's a certain limit to be fair

00:16:25.042 --> 00:16:28.434
and to make sure that both parties
come away from the discussion

00:16:28.458 --> 00:16:30.893
excited about the deal.